{"seq":3,"slug":"dead-letter-queue","title":"死信队列与消息错误处理","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/message-queue-async-patterns/patterns/dead-letter-queue","wordCount":914,"readingTime":4,"html":"<h1 id=\"死信队列与消息错误处理\">死信队列与消息错误处理</h1><p>消息处理不可能 100% 成功。网络抖动、下游服务暂时不可用、业务规则校验失败、代码 Bug——各种原因都会导致消息消费失败。<strong>死信队列（Dead Letter Queue，DLQ）</strong> 是消息系统的&quot;废品桶&quot;：当消息无法被正常处理时，路由到专门的队列存储，供后续排查、修复和重新投递。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>概念</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>死信队列（DLQ）</td>\n<td>存储无法正常消费的消息的专用队列</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>毒消息</td>\n<td>无论重试多少次都会导致消费者崩溃的消息</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>延迟重试队列</td>\n<td>以指数退避方式延迟重新投递的过渡队列</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>最大重试次数</td>\n<td>消费者放弃重试并将消息路由 DLQ 的阈值</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"消息失败的分类\">消息失败的分类</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>失败类型</th>\n<th>原因</th>\n<th>建议策略</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>瞬时失败</td>\n<td>网络超时、下游抖动</td>\n<td>重试（指数退避）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>持久失败</td>\n<td>消息格式错误、Schema 不兼容</td>\n<td>直接路由 DLQ，告警人工修复</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>业务失败</td>\n<td>库存不足、用户已注销</td>\n<td>路由 DLQ + 触发业务补偿</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>毒消息（Poison Message）</td>\n<td>导致消费者崩溃的消息</td>\n<td>超出最大重试次数后强制 DLQ</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"死信队列工作流\">死信队列工作流</h2><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    MQ[主队列\\norders.process] --&gt; CONS[消费者]&#10;    CONS --&gt;|处理成功| ACK[ACK 确认]&#10;    CONS --&gt;|处理失败| RETRY{重试次数\\n&lt; 最大值?}&#10;    RETRY --&gt;|是| DELAY[延迟队列\\n指数退避]&#10;    DELAY --&gt; CONS&#10;    RETRY --&gt;|否| DLQ[死信队列\\norders.process.dlq]&#10;    DLQ --&gt; ALERT[告警通知]&#10;    DLQ --&gt; INSPECTOR[人工检查]&#10;    INSPECTOR --&gt;|修复后重投| MQ&#10;    INSPECTOR --&gt;|确认废弃| DISCARD[归档/丢弃]\">flowchart TD\n    MQ[主队列\\norders.process] --&gt; CONS[消费者]\n    CONS --&gt;|处理成功| ACK[ACK 确认]\n    CONS --&gt;|处理失败| RETRY{重试次数\\n&lt; 最大值?}\n    RETRY --&gt;|是| DELAY[延迟队列\\n指数退避]\n    DELAY --&gt; CONS\n    RETRY --&gt;|否| DLQ[死信队列\\norders.process.dlq]\n    DLQ --&gt; ALERT[告警通知]\n    DLQ --&gt; INSPECTOR[人工检查]\n    INSPECTOR --&gt;|修复后重投| MQ\n    INSPECTOR --&gt;|确认废弃| DISCARD[归档/丢弃]</pre><h2 id=\"rabbitmq-死信配置\">RabbitMQ 死信配置</h2><p>RabbitMQ 通过队列参数 <code>x-dead-letter-exchange</code> 将死信路由到指定 Exchange：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"go\" data-code=\"// 创建带 DLQ 的主队列&#10;ch.QueueDeclare(&#10;    &quot;orders.process&quot;,&#10;    true,  // durable&#10;    false, // autoDelete&#10;    false, // exclusive&#10;    false, // noWait&#10;    amqp.Table{&#10;        &quot;x-dead-letter-exchange&quot;: &quot;orders.dlx&quot;,&#10;        &quot;x-dead-letter-routing-key&quot;: &quot;orders.process.dlq&quot;,&#10;        &quot;x-message-ttl&quot;: 86400000,  // 24h 后未消费也转 DLQ&#10;        &quot;x-max-retries&quot;: 3,&#10;    },&#10;)&#10;&#10;// DLQ 本身（持久化、不自动删除）&#10;ch.QueueDeclare(&quot;orders.process.dlq&quot;, true, false, false, false, nil)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 创建带 DLQ 的主队列</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">ch.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">QueueDeclare</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    \"orders.process\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    true</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,  </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// durable</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    false</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// autoDelete</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    false</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// exclusive</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    false</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// noWait</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">    amqp</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Table</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">        \"x-dead-letter-exchange\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"orders.dlx\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">        \"x-dead-letter-routing-key\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"orders.process.dlq\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">        \"x-message-ttl\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">86400000</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,  </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 24h 后未消费也转 DLQ</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">        \"x-max-retries\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">3</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// DLQ 本身（持久化、不自动删除）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">ch.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">QueueDeclare</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"orders.process.dlq\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">false</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">false</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">false</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">nil</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span></code></pre></div><p>消费者在消费失败时通过 <code>Nack(requeue=false)</code> 将消息转入 DLQ：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"go\" data-code=\"func processMessage(d amqp.Delivery) {&#10;    if err := handler.Process(d.Body); err != nil {&#10;        retryCount := getRetryCount(d.Headers)&#10;        if retryCount &gt;= 3 {&#10;            // 超出重试次数，发往 DLQ&#10;            d.Nack(false, false) // requeue=false&#10;            return&#10;        }&#10;        // 增加重试计数后重新入队&#10;        publishWithRetryCount(d.Body, retryCount+1)&#10;        d.Ack(false)&#10;    } else {&#10;        d.Ack(false)&#10;    }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">func</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> processMessage</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">d</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> amqp</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Delivery</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> err </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> handler.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Process</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(d.Body); err </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">!=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> nil</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        retryCount </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:=</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> getRetryCount</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(d.Headers)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> retryCount </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">>=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 3</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">            // 超出重试次数，发往 DLQ</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            d.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Nack</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">false</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">false</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// requeue=false</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">            return</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">        // 增加重试计数后重新入队</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">        publishWithRetryCount</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(d.Body, retryCount</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        d.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Ack</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">false</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">else</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        d.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Ack</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">false</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"kafka-死信策略\">Kafka 死信策略</h2><p>Kafka 没有内置 DLQ，通常由业务代码实现：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"go\" data-code=\"func (c *Consumer) ConsumeWithDLQ(ctx context.Context) {&#10;    for {&#10;        msg, err := c.reader.FetchMessage(ctx)&#10;        if err != nil {&#10;            break&#10;        }&#10;&#10;        if err := c.processWithRetry(ctx, msg, 3); err != nil {&#10;            // 将失败消息写入 DLQ topic&#10;            dlqMsg := kafka.Message{&#10;                Topic: msg.Topic + &quot;.dlq&quot;,&#10;                Key:   msg.Key,&#10;                Value: msg.Value,&#10;                Headers: append(msg.Headers,&#10;                    kafka.Header{Key: &quot;dlq-reason&quot;, Value: []byte(err.Error())},&#10;                    kafka.Header{Key: &quot;dlq-original-topic&quot;, Value: []byte(msg.Topic)},&#10;                    kafka.Header{Key: &quot;dlq-original-offset&quot;, Value: []byte(strconv.FormatInt(msg.Offset, 10))},&#10;                    kafka.Header{Key: &quot;dlq-timestamp&quot;, Value: []byte(time.Now().Format(time.RFC3339))},&#10;                ),&#10;            }&#10;            c.dlqWriter.WriteMessages(ctx, dlqMsg)&#10;        }&#10;&#10;        c.reader.CommitMessages(ctx, msg)&#10;    }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">func</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shi