--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> c.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">processWithRetry</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(ctx, msg, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">3</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">); err </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">!=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> nil</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">            // 将失败消息写入 DLQ topic</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            dlqMsg </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:=</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> kafka</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Message</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">                Topic: msg.Topic </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \".dlq\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">                Key:   msg.Key,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">                Value: msg.Value,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">                Headers: </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">append</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(msg.Headers,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">                    kafka</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Header</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{Key: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"dlq-reason\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, Value: []</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">byte</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(err.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Error</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">())},</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">                    kafka</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Header</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{Key: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"dlq-original-topic\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, Value: []</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">byte</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(msg.Topic)},</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">                    kafka</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Header</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{Key: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"dlq-original-offset\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, Value: []</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">byte</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(strconv.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">FormatInt</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(msg.Offset, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">10</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">))},</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">                    kafka</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Header</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{Key: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"dlq-timestamp\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, Value: []</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">byte</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(time.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Now</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">().</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Format</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(time.RFC3339))},</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">                ),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            c.dlqWriter.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">WriteMessages</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(ctx, dlqMsg)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        c.reader.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">CommitMessages</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(ctx, msg)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"延迟重试队列\">延迟重试队列</h2><p>直接重试容易造成&quot;重试风暴&quot;压垮下游。<strong>延迟队列</strong>实现指数退避：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>重试次数</th>\n<th>等待时间</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>第 1 次</td>\n<td>30 秒</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>第 2 次</td>\n<td>2 分钟</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>第 3 次</td>\n<td>10 分钟</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>超出最大</td>\n<td>路由 DLQ</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>RabbitMQ 使用 <code>x-delayed-message</code> 插件或 TTL + 空队列转发实现延迟；Kafka 通常用独立的延迟 topic（<code>orders.retry.30s</code>、<code>orders.retry.2m</code>）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"dlq-监控与告警\">DLQ 监控与告警</h2><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"yaml\" data-code=\"# Prometheus 告警规则&#10;groups:&#10;  - name: dlq_alerts&#10;    rules:&#10;      - alert: DLQMessageAccumulating&#10;        expr: kafka_consumer_group_lag{topic=~&quot;.*\\\\.dlq&quot;} &gt; 10&#10;        for: 5m&#10;        annotations:&#10;          summary: &#39;DLQ 积压超过 10 条，需人工检查&#39;&#10;&#10;      - alert: DLQMessageAgeHigh&#10;        expr: kafka_dlq_oldest_message_age_seconds &gt; 3600&#10;        for: 0m&#10;        annotations:&#10;          summary: &#39;DLQ 有超过 1 小时的未处理消息&#39;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># Prometheus 告警规则</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">groups</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">dlq_alerts</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    rules</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">alert</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">DLQMessageAccumulating</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        expr</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">kafka_consumer_group_lag{topic=~\".*\\\\.dlq\"} > 10</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">5m</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        annotations</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">          summary</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'DLQ 积压超过 10 条，需人工检查'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">alert</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">DLQMessageAgeHigh</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        expr</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">kafka_dlq_oldest_message_age_seconds > 3600</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">0m</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        annotations</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">          summary</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'DLQ 有超过 1 小时的未处理消息'</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>DLQ 仪表盘关键指标</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>DLQ 队列深度（实时积压量）</li>\n<li>每分钟新增 DLQ 消息数（失败率趋势）</li>\n<li>消息平均停留时间（处理及时性）</li>\n<li>失败原因分布（引导修复优先级）</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"人工干预与重投递\">人工干预与重投递</h2><p>DLQ 消息在人工修复问题后需要重新投递，常见工具：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"# Kafka：使用 kafka-console-consumer + kafka-console-producer 重投&#10;kafka-console-consumer --bootstrap-server localhost:9092 \\&#10;  --topic orders.process.dlq --from-beginning \\&#10;  | kafka-console-producer --bootstrap-server localhost:9092 \\&#10;  --topic orders.process&#10;&#10;# 或使用专用管理工具（如 Kafdrop、AKHQ）的 UI 重投功能\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># Kafka：使用 kafka-console-consumer + kafka-console-producer 重投</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">kafka-console-consumer</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --bootstrap-server</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> localhost:9092</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> \\</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  --topic</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> orders.process.dlq</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --from-beginning</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> \\</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  |</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> kafka-console-producer</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --bootstrap-server</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> localhost:9092</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> \\</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  --topic</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> orders.process</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 或使用专用管理工具（如 Kafdrop、AKHQ）的 UI 重投功能</span></span></code></pre></div><p>也可以编写自动化重投脚本，在业务修复部署后自动触发 DLQ 消息重处理。</p>\n<h2 id=\"毒消息识别与隔离\">毒消息识别与隔离</h2><p><strong>毒消息</strong>是指无论重试多少次都会导致消费者崩溃的消息（如格式畸形、触发消费者 OOM）：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"go\" data-code=\"// 使用 recover 捕获 panic，避免毒消息影响其他消息&#10;func safeProcess(msg Message, handler Handler) (err error) {&#10;    defer func() {&#10;        if r := recover(); r != nil {&#10;            err = fmt.Errorf(&quot;消费者 panic: %v&quot;, r)&#10;        }&#10;    }()&#10;    return handler.Process(msg)&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 使用 recover 捕获 panic，避免毒消息影响其他消息</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">func</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> safeProcess</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">msg</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Message</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">handler</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Handler</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) (</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">err</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> error</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    defer</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> func</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> r </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:=</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> recover</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(); r </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">!=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> nil</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            err </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> fmt.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Errorf</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"消费者 panic: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">%v</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, r)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> handler.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Process</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(msg)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>识别到毒消息后立即路由 DLQ 并标记 <code>is_poison=true</code>，人工分析后决定是修复消费者逻辑还是丢弃该消息。</p>\n<h2 id=\"常见-dlq-反模式\">常见 DLQ 反模式</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>DLQ 无人监控</strong>：设而不管，积压数万条后才发现，修复成本极高</li>\n<li><strong>无限重试不设上限</strong>：消费者陷入重试死循环，CPU 和队列资源被持续消耗</li>\n<li><strong>DLQ 本身不持久化</strong>：重启后 DLQ 消息丢失，等于没有 DLQ</li>\n<li><strong>重投时不修复根因</strong>：从 DLQ 重投后消息再次进入 DLQ，循环往复</li>\n</ul>\n<p>与 <a href=\"saga-choreography\">Saga 编排与协作模式</a> 联动：Saga 补偿失败的消息应路由至 DLQ 待人工处理；与<a href=\"../fundamentals/message-queue-concepts\">消息队列核心概念</a>中的投递语义结合理解 ACK/NACK 机制。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>死信队列是消息系统可靠性的最后防线。合理设计 DLQ 架构需要：明确失败分类、配置合理的重试次数与退避策略、将 DLQ 纳入监控告警体系、并建立人工审查和重投递流程。DLQ 不是&quot;垃圾桶&quot;而是&quot;待处理区&quot;——每一条 DLQ 消息都是一个需要被修复的信号。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"死信队列与消息错误处理","id":"死信队列与消息错误处理"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"消息失败的分类","id":"消息失败的分类"},{"level":2,"text":"死信队列工作流","id":"死信队列工作流"},{"level":2,"text":"RabbitMQ 死信配置","id":"rabbitmq-死信配置"},{"level":2,"text":"Kafka 死信策略","id":"kafka-死信策略"},{"level":2,"text":"延迟重试队列","id":"延迟重试队列"},{"level":2,"text":"DLQ 监控与告警","id":"dlq-监控与告警"},{"level":2,"text":"人工干预与重投递","id":"人工干预与重投递"},{"level":2,"text":"毒消息识别与隔离","id":"毒消息识别与隔离"},{"level":2,"text":"常见 DLQ 反模式","id":"常见-dlq-反模式"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"事件溯源与消息系统集成","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/message-queue-async-patterns/patterns/event-sourcing-messaging"},"next":{"title":"Kafka 深度实践","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/message-queue-async-patterns/systems/kafka-in-depth"}}